{"id": "f2b8f552-7eb8-4e39-9eaa-137db21d61d0", "slug": "continuous-data-platform-1", "title": "Continuous Data Platform", "description": "Continuous Data CTA Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Continuous Data Platform\"\ndescription: \"Continuous Data CTA Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#3B82F6\"\n  secondary: \"#4338CA\"\n  accent: \"#4338CA\"\n  background: \"#0B1120\"\n  surface: \"#94A3B8\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Continuous Data Platform\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 3; favorites: 1; remixes: 1.\nTags: cta, animated, webgl, charts, navigation, links, flow, action.\n## Overview\nContinuous Data CTA Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNexusStream Platform Solutions Developers Resources Company Start Free Unify streaming & batch instantly NexusStream empowers you to build real-time analytical workflows effortlessly. Connect any source, apply complex t…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Unify streaming & batch instantly.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #4338CA, accent #4338CA, background #0B1120, surface #94A3B8, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Continuous Data Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0B1120] text-slate-50 font-sans min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden relative selection:bg-blue-900/60 selection:text-blue-50\">\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"absolute top-0 w-full z-50 flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-6 md:px-10\">\n        <!-- Logo -->\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xl tracking-tight font-semibold text-slate-100\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:data-bold-duotone\" width=\"1.5rem\" height=\"1.5rem\" class=\"text-blue-500\"></iconify-icon>\n            NexusStream\n        </a>\n\n        <!-- Desktop Navigation -->\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1 p-1 bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full border border-slate-700/60 shadow-sm\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-full bg-slate-700 text-blue-400 shadow-sm shadow-black/20 transition-all\">Platform</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-full text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-100 transition-all\">Solutions</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-full text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-100 transition-all\">Developers</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-full text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-100 transition-all\">Resources</a>\n            <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer px-5 py-2 flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium rounded-full text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-100 transition-all\">\n                Company\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"1rem\" height=\"1rem\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- CTA -->\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:inline-flex px-6 py-2 rounded-full border border-blue-500 text-blue-400 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-blue-500/10 transition-colors\">\n            Start Free\n        </a>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 pt-40 md:pt-52 pb-24 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start min-h-screen pointer-events-none\">\n\n        <!-- Left Text Content -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[45%] flex flex-col items-start pointer-events-auto mt-10 md:mt-0\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-serif tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6 text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-400 via-blue-400 to-cyan-300\">\n                Unify streaming & batch instantly\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-lg text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-md leading-relaxed\">\n                NexusStream empowers you to build real-time analytical workflows effortlessly. Connect any source, apply complex transformations via standard SQL, and serve insights to your applications with zero latency.\n            </p>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full text-base font-medium shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-900/70 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all group\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white/20 rounded-full p-1 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-white/30 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"1.2rem\" height=\"1.2rem\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                Deploy Now\n            </a>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Animated WebGL-like Background (SVG) -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1440 900\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90\">\n            <defs>\n                <!-- Gradients for Ribbons -->\n                <linearGradient id=\"grad-teal\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n                    <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\" />\n                    <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#2dd4bf\" />\n                </linearGradient>\n                <linearGradient id=\"grad-blue\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n                    <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#1d4ed8\" />\n                    <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#60a5fa\" />\n                </linearGradient>\n                <linearGradient id=\"grad-indigo\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n                    <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#4338ca\" />\n                    <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#818cf8\" />\n                </linearGradient>\n                <linearGradient id=\"grad-slate\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n                    <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#475569\" />\n                    <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#94a3b8\" />\n                </linearGradient>\n\n                <!-- Filters for Nodes -->\n                <filter id=\"shadow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n                    <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"8\" stdDeviation=\"6\" flood-color=\"#000000\" flood-opacity=\"0.5\" />\n                </filter>\n            </defs>\n\n            <!-- Base Paths (Shadows/Depth) -->\n            <path d=\"M -200 680 C 400 680, 800 480, 1600 280\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"40\" opacity=\"0.05\" style=\"transform: translateY(10px)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M -200 700 C 400 700, 900 580, 1600 480\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"45\" opacity=\"0.05\" style=\"transform: translateY(10px)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M -200 720 C 400 720, 900 740, 1600 840\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"50\" opacity=\"0.05\" style=\"transform: translateY(10px)\"/>\n\n            <!-- Main Color Ribbons -->\n            <!-- Slate Ribbon (Bottom) -->\n            <path id=\"path-slate\" d=\"M -200 740 C 400 740, 800 880, 1600 1080\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#grad-slate)\" stroke-width=\"60\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <!-- Indigo Ribbon -->\n            <path id=\"path-indigo\" d=\"M -200 720 C 400 720, 900 740, 1600 840\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#grad-indigo)\" stroke-width=\"50\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <!-- Blue Ribbon -->\n            <path id=\"path-blue\" d=\"M -200 700 C 400 700, 900 580, 1600 480\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#grad-blue)\" stroke-width=\"45\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <!-- Teal Ribbon (Top) -->\n            <path id=\"path-teal\" d=\"M -200 680 C 400 680, 800 480, 1600 280\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#grad-teal)\" stroke-width=\"40\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n\n            <!-- Transparent Data Wrappers (Geometric segments on ribbons) -->\n            <g stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\" opacity=\"0.2\">\n                <!-- Wrapper on Teal -->\n                <polygon points=\"100,670 140,665 140,695 100,700\" />\n                <polygon points=\"100,670 110,660 150,655 140,665\" />\n\n                <!-- Wrapper on Blue -->\n                <polygon points=\"400,675 450,665 450,705 400,715\" />\n                <polygon points=\"400,675 415,660 465,650 450,665\" />\n\n                <!-- Wrapper on Indigo -->\n                <polygon points=\"750,715 820,718 820,760 750,757\" />\n                <polygon points=\"750,715 765,700 835,703 820,718\" />\n            </g>\n\n            <!-- Animated Data Streams (Dashed lines) -->\n            <g stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.8\">\n                <!-- Data packets logic: long array, gap, fast offset -->\n                <path d=\"M -200 680 C 400 680, 800 480, 1600 280\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 60 20 120\" class=\"stream-anim\" style=\"stroke-width: 3;\" />\n                <path d=\"M -200 680 C 400 680, 800 480, 1600 280\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 200\" stroke=\"#ccfbf1\" class=\"stream-anim-fast\" />\n\n                <path d=\"M -200 700 C 400 700, 900 580, 1600 480\" stroke-dasharray=\"15 80 5 100\" class=\"stream-anim\" style=\"stroke-width: 4;\"/>\n                <path d=\"M -200 700 C 400 700, 900 580, 1600 480\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 150\" stroke=\"#bfdbfe\" class=\"stream-anim-fast\" />\n\n                <path d=\"M -200 720 C 400 720, 900 740, 1600 840\" stroke-dasharray=\"30 100 10 60\" class=\"stream-anim\" style=\"stroke-width: 3;\"/>\n                <path d=\"M -200 720 C 400 720, 900 740, 1600 840\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 250\" stroke=\"#e0e7ff\" class=\"stream-anim-fast\" />\n\n                <path d=\"M -200 740 C 400 740, 800 880, 1600 1080\" stroke-dasharray=\"12 40 2 80\" class=\"stream-anim\" style=\"stroke-width: 2;\"/>\n            </g>\n\n            <!-- Small data points (Dots on lines) -->\n            <g fill=\"#e2e8f0\" class=\"data-dots\">\n                <circle cx=\"600\" cy=\"578\" r=\"4\" />\n                <circle cx=\"950\" cy=\"558\" r=\"5\" />\n                <circle cx=\"850\" cy=\"733\" r=\"4\" />\n                <circle cx=\"1250\" cy=\"780\" r=\"5\" />\n                <circle cx=\"1100\" cy=\"940\" r=\"4\" />\n            </g>\n\n            <!-- Vertical Connection Lines -->\n            <g stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.6\">\n                <!-- Node 1 (Cube) Connection -->\n                <line x1=\"980\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"980\" y2=\"445\" />\n                <!-- Node 2 (Pie) Connection -->\n                <line x1=\"1280\" y1=\"460\" x2=\"1280\" y2=\"520\" />\n                <!-- Node 3 (Grid) Connection -->\n                <line x1=\"900\" y1=\"830\" x2=\"900\" y2=\"733\" />\n                <!-- Node 4 (Small Grid) Connection -->\n                <line x1=\"1200\" y1=\"785\" x2=\"1200\" y2=\"765\" />\n                <line x1=\"1200\" y1=\"840\" x2=\"1200\" y2=\"905\" />\n            </g>\n\n            <!-- Floating Nodes -->\n            <!-- Node 1: Isometric Cube -->\n            <g class=\"float-node\" style=\"transform-origin: 980px 320px;\">\n                <polygon points=\"980,260 1030,290 1030,350 980,380 930,350 930,290\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"/>\n                <!-- Inner Cube -->\n                <polygon points=\"980,270 1020,295 980,320 940,295\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" /> <!-- Top -->\n                <polygon points=\"940,295 980,320 980,370 940,345\" fill=\"#1e40af\" /> <!-- Left -->\n                <polygon points=\"1020,295 980,320 980,370 1020,345\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\" /> <!-- Right -->\n            </g>\n\n            <!-- Node 2: Pie Chart -->\n            <g class=\"float-node\" style=\"transform-origin: 1280px 420px; animation-delay: -1s;\">\n                <circle cx=\"1280\" cy=\"420\" r=\"45\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"1280\" cy=\"420\" r=\"35\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n                <!-- Pie Slices -->\n                <path d=\"M 1280 420 L 1280 385 A 35 35 0 0 1 1310 402 Z\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" />\n                <path d=\"M 1280 420 L 1310 402 A 35 35 0 0 1 1295 450 Z\" fill=\"#4338ca\" />\n                <path d=\"M 1280 420 L 1295 450 A 35 35 0 0 1 1245 420 Z\" fill=\"#0d9488\" />\n                <path d=\"M 1280 420 L 1245 420 A 35 35 0 0 1 1280 385 Z\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n            </g>\n\n            <!-- Node 3: Large Grid -->\n            <g class=\"float-node\" style=\"transform-origin: 1200px 810px; animation-delay: -2s;\">\n                <rect x=\"1165\" y=\"750\" width=\"70\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"/>\n                <!-- Inner Grid Items -->\n                <rect x=\"1175\" y=\"760\" width=\"15\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" />\n                <rect x=\"1195\" y=\"760\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#818cf8\" />\n                <rect x=\"1215\" y=\"760\" width=\"10\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" />\n\n                <rect x=\"1195\" y=\"780\" width=\"15\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" />\n\n                <rect x=\"1175\" y=\"800\" width=\"15\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#0d9488\" />\n                <rect x=\"1195\" y=\"810\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#4338ca\" />\n                <rect x=\"1215\" y=\"810\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#1e40af\" />\n            </g>\n\n            <!-- Node 4: Small Grid (Bottom Left) -->\n            <g class=\"float-node\" style=\"transform-origin: 900px 870px; animation-delay: -0.5s;\">\n                <rect x=\"860\" y=\"830\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"/>\n                <!-- Inner Pixels -->\n                <rect x=\"872\" y=\"842\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#2dd4bf\" />\n                <rect x=\"892\" y=\"842\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#818cf8\" />\n                <rect x=\"912\" y=\"842\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" />\n\n                <rect x=\"872\" y=\"862\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#4338ca\" />\n                <rect x=\"892\" y=\"862\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" />\n                <rect x=\"912\" y=\"862\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#1e40af\" />\n\n                <rect x=\"872\" y=\"882\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#0d9488\" />\n                <rect x=\"892\" y=\"882\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" />\n                <rect x=\"912\" y=\"882\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#0f766e\" />\n            </g>\n\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Inline script for WebGL-like continuous animations -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const streams = document.querySelectorAll('.stream-anim');\n            const fastStreams = document.querySelectorAll('.stream-anim-fast');\n            const floatNodes = document.querySelectorAll('.float-node');\n\n            let offset = 0;\n            let time = 0;\n\n            function animate() {\n                // Stream flow animation\n                offset -= 1.5;\n                streams.forEach(stream => {\n                    stream.style.strokeDashoffset = offset;\n                });\n                fastStreams.forEach(stream => {\n                    stream.style.strokeDashoffset = offset * 2.5;\n                });\n\n                // Subtle floating animation for nodes\n                time += 0.03;\n                floatNodes.forEach((node, index) => {\n                    // Use index to create different phases\n                    const yOffset = Math.sin(time + index * 2) * 8;\n                    // Apply translation without overriding transform-origin\n                    node.style.transform = `translateY(${yOffset}px)`;\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n\n            // Start animation loop\n            animate();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "continuous-data-platform-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/continuous-data-platform-1.jpg", "source_name": "continuous-data-platform-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 107, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T02:37:34.930796+00:00"}